# Local CI Checklist

Run ALL steps below (in order) before pushing any commit. These mirror `.github/actions/flutter_package/action.yaml` exactly.

## 1 — Install dependencies (root + example)

```bash
flutter pub get
cd example && flutter pub get && cd ..
```

> Always run `flutter pub get` in **both** directories. The `example/` project has its own `pubspec.lock` and `.dart_tool/package_config.json`. A stale `package_config.json` in `example/` will make `dart format` crash with a `PathNotFoundException` for a cached package that no longer exists locally.

## 2 — Format (root, covers example via recursive walk)

```bash
dart format --set-exit-if-changed .
```

Exit code 1 means files changed → commit the formatted output and retry.

> **Scope matters.** `dart format .` walks the entire tree from the current directory. Always run it from the **repo root**, not from a sub-folder.

## 3 — Analyze (root lib + test only)

```bash
dart analyze --fatal-infos --fatal-warnings lib test
```

> **Scope matters.** CI targets `lib test` (not `.` and not `example/`). Running `dart analyze` inside `example/` or without the directory arguments will silently miss infos/warnings in the main package.

Common things caught here that are missed when using the wrong scope:
- `unnecessary_import` in test files (e.g. importing a symbol already re-exported by a barrel)
- Unused variables / dead code
- Missing `const`

## 4 — Tests

```bash
flutter test --no-pub --test-randomize-ordering-seed random
```

## 5 — Quick pub score check (optional but recommended before tagging)

```bash
dart pub global activate pana
pana . --no-warning
```

Score must be 130/130. Any loss means a missing `dartdoc`, bad `example/`, or broken `pubspec.yaml`.

---

## Dependency alignment rule

`example/pubspec.yaml` dev-dependencies **must** match the version constraints in the root `pubspec.yaml`. Specifically:

```yaml
# root pubspec.yaml           example/pubspec.yaml
very_good_analysis: ^10.0.0   very_good_analysis: ^10.0.0  ✓
very_good_analysis: ^10.0.0   very_good_analysis: ^7.0.0   ✗  (will break dart format locally)
```

When bumping an analysis/linter dep in the root, bump the same dep in `example/pubspec.yaml` in the same commit.

---

## Commit gate — checklist before `git push`

- [ ] `flutter pub get` passed (root)
- [ ] `flutter pub get` passed (example)
- [ ] `dart format --set-exit-if-changed .` → 0 changed
- [ ] `dart analyze --fatal-infos --fatal-warnings lib test` → No issues found
- [ ] `flutter test` → All tests passed
